Title: Workspace Creation & Task Setup Flow
participant User
participant "Web Dashboard"
participant "API Gateway"
participant "Workspace Service"
participant "Main Database"
participant "Message Queue"

User->Web Dashboard: Click "Create Workspace"
Web Dashboard->API Gateway: POST /api/workspaces
API Gateway->Workspace Service: Provision Workspace (payload)
Workspace Service->Main Database: INSERT INTO workspaces (...)
Main Database-->>Workspace Service: 201 Created (workspace_id)
Workspace Service->Message Queue: Publish event "workspace.created"
Workspace Service-->>API Gateway: 201 Created (workspace_id, slug)
API Gateway-->>Web Dashboard: 201 Created (workspace_id, slug)
Web Dashboard-->>User: Redirect to Workspace Dashboard
